d 1 with 7,309 passing, 4 failing, and 3 skipped unit tests; the 5-test perf suite passed. The four failures were 25 ms performance budgets in event-link-times, frees-marks, keep-moving-marks-surface, and off-clock-link-chips. The same four files passed when rerun serially: 110/110. This does not change the failed full npm test result.\n\nsase bead epic-symbols bob-cli-ms.8.3.1.1 passed with no entries. The requested bob-cli just check has not yet completed and will be staged through sase monitor. Because the full plugin npm test gate failed and just check is pending, this phase remains in_progress and is not being closed. bob-cli-ms.8.3.1.2 remains in_progress and unchanged."}}
